OL,3,AChannel 4 to cut 340 jobs by the end of
OL,4,Athe year in major shake-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FChannel 4 has said it plans to cut 340
OL,7,Fjobs before the end of the year,
OL,8,Freducing its workforce by more than a
OL,9,Fquarter.
OL,11,FThe network, which broadcasts Gogglebox
OL,12,Fand The Great British Bake Off, will
OL,13,Flose around 28% of its current 1,270
OL,14,Fstaff following a strategic review of
OL,15,Fthe organisation.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
